          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1,
            "endIndex": 92,
            "text": "The Swiss Ice Hockey Federation (SIHF) is the governing body for ice hockey in Switzerland."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0,
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 93,
            "endIndex": 248,
            "text": "It was founded on September 27, 1908, and is a founding member of the International Ice Hockey Federation (IIHF), which recognized it on November 23, 1908."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 249,
            "endIndex": 380,
            "text": "The SIHF manages both amateur and professional ice hockey within Switzerland, including national teams at junior and senior levels."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 382,
            "endIndex": 473,
            "text": "**Business Model:**\nThe SIHF operates as the overarching organization for Swiss ice hockey."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 474,
            "endIndex": 812,
            "text": "Its business model revolves around overseeing and developing the sport through several key sectors: \"Sport\" (National Teams, Talent & Youth Sport), \"Leagues & Cup\" (organizing championships for various leagues and cup tournaments), \"Officiating\" (managing referees), and \"Education\" (initial and continuous training for Swiss ice hockey)."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 813,
            "endIndex": 986,
            "text": "The SIHF also engages in marketing and sponsorship activities, with partners like Denner, KPT, Swiss Life, and official broadcasters, which likely contribute to its funding."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 988,
            "endIndex": 1150,
            "text": "**Key Products/Services:**\nThe SIHF's core services include:\n*   **National Teams:** Managing men's, women's, and junior national teams (U20, U18, U17, U16, U14)."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1151,
            "endIndex": 1352,
            "text": "*   **League and Cup Organization:** Organizing various championships, including the National League, Sky Swiss League, MyHockey League, PostFinance Women's League, junior leagues, and cup tournaments."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1353,
            "endIndex": 1516,
            "text": "*   **Youth and Talent Development:** Implementing programs like \"Foundation, Talent, Elite, Mastery\" and \"swissmadehockey\" guidelines for training junior players."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1517,
            "endIndex": 1622,
            "text": "It also includes initiatives like the Denner Swiss Ice Hockey Day and the Swiss Ice Hockey School Trophy."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1623,
            "endIndex": 1675,
            "text": "*   **Officiating:** Training and managing referees."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1676,
            "endIndex": 1780,
            "text": "*   **Education:** Providing initial and continuing education for the entire Swiss ice hockey community."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1781,
            "endIndex": 1866,
            "text": "*   **Events:** Hosting events like the Swiss Ice Hockey Night and awards ceremonies."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 1868,
            "endIndex": 2002,
            "text": "**Market Position:**\nThe SIHF holds the exclusive position as the governing body of ice hockey in Switzerland, recognized by the IIHF."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 2003,
            "endIndex": 2175,
            "text": "It oversees the entire structure of Swiss ice hockey, from grassroots youth development to professional leagues and national team representation on the international stage."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            0,
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 2177,
            "endIndex": 2321,
            "text": "**Headquarters Location:**\nThe headquarters of the Swiss Ice Hockey Federation is located at Flughofstrasse 50, CH-8152 Glattbrugg, Switzerland."
          },
          "groundingChunkIndices": [
            1
          ]
        },
        {
          "segment": {
            "startIndex": 2323,
            "endIndex": 2449,
            "text": "**Recent News / Notable Achievements:**\n*   The SIHF was a founding member of the International Ice Hockey Federation in 1908."
